-cid-y2vllrex>UX / UI Design</span><span class="chip" data-astro-cid-y2vllrex>Web Development</span></div></div></a></div><a class="view-all" href="https://dovvstudio.com/work" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>View All</span><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8.5 7H17v8.5" stroke="#000" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></a></section><section class="testimonials" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="testimonials" data-testimonials data-interval="8000" data-appear="{&quot;from&quot;:{&quot;y&quot;:30},&quot;trigger&quot;:&quot;inview&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:1,&quot;bounce&quot;:0.2,&quot;delay&quot;:0.3}" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><div class="side" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><div class="line" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><span data-astro-cid-gakqr736></span></div><div class="controls" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><div class="arrows" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><button type="button" class="arrow" aria-label="Previous testimonial" data-prev data-astro-cid-gakqr736><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><path d="M19 12H5M11 6l-6 6 6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-astro-cid-gakqr736></path></svg></button><button type="button" class="arrow" aria-label="Next testimonial" data-next data-astro-cid-gakqr736><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-astro-cid-gakqr736></path></svg></button></div><p class="counter" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><span data-current data-astro-cid-gakqr736>01</span>/05</p></div><div class="stat" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><p class="stat-num" data-astro-cid-gakqr736>15+</p><p class="stat-text" data-astro-cid-gakqr736>Projects shipped,<br data-astro-cid-gakqr736>from startups to studios</p></div></div><div class="slides" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><figure class="slide active" data-slide data-astro-cid-gakqr736><blockquote class="quote" data-words data-astro-cid-gakqr736>Dario helped us improve the Coderhouse website with great design ideas and solid execution. He’s creative, detail-oriented, and easy to work with. Would definitely recommend him for any product or web design work.</blockquote><figcaption class="author" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><span class="tile" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><img src="../cdn.sanity.io/images/5p2cnzq3/production/37abee354114b9c68787fae47fbbaba362b6c24c-1990x10886893.png?w=200&amp;q=85&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" alt="Coderhouse" width="66" height="66" data-astro-cid-gakqr736></span><span class="who" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><span class="name" data-astro-cid-gakqr736>Christian Patiño</span><span class="role" data-astro-cid-gakqr736>Founder at <a href="https://www.coderhouse.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-astro-cid-gakqr736>Coderhouse</a></span></span></figcaption></figure><figure class="slide" data-slide aria-hidden="true" inert data-astro-cid-gakqr736><blockquote class="quote" data-words data-astro-cid-gakqr736>Dario turned our vision into a top-tier digital experience. His creativity, expertise, and attention to detail exceeded expectations. We hired him again immediately—highly recommended!</blockquote><figcaption class="author" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><span class="tile" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><img src="../cdn.sanity.io/images/5p2cnzq3/production/4d551608b6673b92c690aab16fe772a526578b19-309x1856893.png?w=200&amp;q=85&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" alt="Motum" width="46" height="46" data-astro-cid-gakqr736></span><span class="who" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><span class="name" data-astro-cid-gakqr736>Victor McInerney</span><span class="role" data-astro-cid-gakqr736>Founder at Motum</span></span></figcaption></figure><figure class="slide" data-slide aria-hidden="true" inert data-astro-cid-gakqr736><blockquote class="quote" data-words data-astro-cid-gakqr736>He understood exactly what we wanted and adapted perfectly to our vision. Communication was always clear and easy, and he delivered everything on time with great attention to detail.</blockquote><figcaption class="author" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><span class="tile" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><img class="fit" src="../cdn.sanity.io/images/5p2cnzq3/production/278504603af0b72eef7af7b6f2e650867e4ee019-3508x24816893.png?w=200&amp;q=85&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" alt="ENDER" width="74" height="52" data-astro-cid-gakqr736></span><span class="who" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><span class="name" data-astro-cid-gakqr736>Federico Deyá</span><span class="role" data-astro-cid-gakqr736>Founder at ENDER</span></span></figcaption></figure><figure class="slide" data-slide aria-hidden="true" inert data-astro-cid-gakqr736><blockquote class="quote" data-words data-astro-cid-gakqr736>Dario was fantastic to work with. He turned our Figma designs into a live Framer site within 24 hours, was super responsive to feedback, and handled every detail quickly. Highly recommend.</blockquote><figcaption class="author" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><span class="tile" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><img src="../cdn.sanity.io/images/5p2cnzq3/production/5fb69755baf65857932b1ffd17a26e71518c856b-160x1606893.png?w=200&amp;q=85&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" alt="Day30" width="56" height="56" data-astro-cid-gakqr736></span><span class="who" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><span class="name" data-astro-cid-gakqr736>Shumel Lais</span><span class="role" data-astro-cid-gakqr736>Client at Day30</span></span></figcaption></figure><figure class="slide" data-slide aria-hidden="true" inert data-astro-cid-gakqr736><blockquote class="quote" data-words data-astro-cid-gakqr736>Amazing experience! Dario took the time to understand the vision and kept me updated in every step of the way to ensure I was satisfied with the progress. He is committed, skilled and reliable. Highly recommended for sure, 5 Stars!</blockquote><figcaption class="author" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><span class="tile" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><span class="initial" data-astro-cid-gakqr736>J</span></span><span class="who" data-astro-cid-gakqr736><span class="name" data-astro-cid-gakqr736>Josü</span><span class="role" data-astro-cid-gakqr736>Client</span></span></figcaption></figure></div></div><script type="module">globalThis.process??={},globalThis.process.env??={},document.querySelectorAll(`[data-testimonials]`).forEach(e=>{let t=[...e.querySelectorAll(`[data-slide]`)],n=e.querySelector(`[data-current]`),r=Number(e.dataset.interval||8e3);e.style.setProperty(`--interval`,`${r}ms`);let i=window.matchMedia(`(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)`).matches,a=0,o,s=!1;e.querySelectorAll(`[data-words]`).forEach(e=>{let t=(e.textContent??``).trim().split(/\s+/);e.setAttribute(`aria-label`,`“${t.join(` `)}”`),e.innerHTML=t.map((e,n)=>`<span class="w" aria-hidden="true" style="--n:${n}">${n===0?`“`:``}${e}${n===t.length-1?`”`:``}</span>`).join(` `)});let c=e=>{t.forEach(e=>e.classList.remove(`lit`)),e.offsetWidth,requestAnimationFrame(()=>e.classList.add(`lit`))},l=()=>{e.classList.remove(`running`),e.offsetWidth,i||e.classList.add(`running`)},u=e=>{a=(e+t.length)%t.length,t.forEach((e,t)=>{let n=t===a;e.classList.toggle(`active`,n),n?e.removeAttribute(`aria-hidden`):e.setAttribute(`aria-hidden`,`true`),e.inert=!n}),n.textContent=String(a+1).padStart(2,`0`),c(t[a]),l(),d()},d=()=>{window.clearTimeout(o),!(i||!s||e.classList.contains(`paused`))&&(o=window.setTimeout(()=>u(a+1),r))};e.querySelector(`[data-prev]`)?.addEventListener(`click`,()=>u(a-1)),e.querySelector(`[data-next]`)?.addEventListener(`click`,()=>u(a+1)),e.addEventListener(`mouseenter`,()=>{e.classList.add(`paused`),window.clearTimeout(o)}),e.addEventListener(`mouseleave`,()=>{e.classList.remove(`paused`),l(),d()});let f=new IntersectionObserver(e=>{e.some(e=>e.isIntersecting)&&(f.disconnect(),s=!0,u(0))},{threshold:.4});f.observe(e)});</script></section><section class="dark-wrap" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><!-- Curved top edge: bulges up more as the block scrolls into view --><svg class="dome" aria-hidden="true" data-dome viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><!-- Single soft arc: flat tangents at the sides, highest point in the middle --><path d="M0 100 Q50 -100 100 100 Z" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></path></svg><div class="dark" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="about-wrap" id="about" data-astro-cid-j4y4sje3><div class="me" data-reveal-section data-astro-cid-j4y4sje3><div class="me-side" data-astro-cid-j4y4sje3><p class="eyebrow" data-astro-cid-j4y4sje3>About the studio</p><!-- 3D character; it turns as you scroll --><div class="me-visual" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j4y4sje3><div class="avatar ps2" data-poly-avatar data-src="https://dovvstudio.com/models/dario.glb" data-spin="scroll" data-look="ps2" data-astro-cid-jfcrd6gy><div class="canvas" data-poly-canvas aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-jfcrd6gy></div></div><script type="module" src="https://dovvstudio.com/_astro/PolyAvatar.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.WiI5pLyN.js"></script></div></div><div class="me-main" data-astro-cid-j4y4sje3><p class="statement" data-word-reveal data-astro-cid-j4y4sje3>I&#39;m Dario, the designer and developer behind DOVV. I design and build websites from the first sketch to the last line of code, so strategy, design and Framer development stay in the same hands and nothing gets lost along the way.</p><ul class="points" data-astro-cid-j4y4sje3><li data-astro-cid-j4y4sje3>Human design, AI assisted process</li><li data-astro-cid-j4y4sje3>A direct line, no handoffs</li><li data-astro-cid-j4y4sje3>15+ projects shipped</li><li data-astro-cid-j4y4sje3>Also building <a class="inline-link" href="https://iura.ar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-astro-cid-j4y4sje3>IURA</a>, for law firms</li></ul></div></div></div